From aae3c461f5aa59a5822751a5dfc1fc82f76fb001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 11:06:13 +0200
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sm7225-fairphone-fp4: Disable PMK8350 PON

From: Luca Weiss <luca.weiss@fairphone.com>

[ Upstream commit 5c088a33e3a9bb236c475b7230df275fc1e51eda ]

Two PMICs on this phone have a PON block, the PM6350 and PMK8350. Only
one should be enabled at one time, so disable PMK8350 PON and keep the
PM6350 PON.

Fixes: 582e7c1026fa ("arm64: dts: qcom: sm7225-fairphone-fp4: Add pmk8350 PMIC")
Signed-off-by: Luca Weiss <luca.weiss@fairphone.com>
Reviewed-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260901-fp4-pmk8350-pon-v1-1-e05937e9c860@fairphone.com
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>
[ sashal: Added the &pmk8350_pon disable override by hand before &pmk8350_rtc, since the board file here lacks the upstream USB, PM8008 and thermal context lines. ]
Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts
index 2c6f37864a5de..fccbb05efb1f7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts
@@ -511,6 +511,10 @@ conn-therm@1 {
 	};
 };
 
+&pmk8350_pon {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
 &pmk8350_rtc {
 	status = "okay";
 };
-- 
2.53.0

